= Appeal to the Navy

The Republic Navy's officers took an oath to the constitution.

- @do: Appeal to the Navy.
- @easy_discard

@do
on-arrival: navy_loyalty += 10

Admirals receive personal messages from the senators of their home worlds. Some reply. Most do not. But a few cruisers change their patrol routes.
